# Build context for e2e/Dockerfile is the repository root. This file (named
# after the Dockerfile) replaces the root .dockerignore for this build: the
# e2e image must keep the app source (src/, public/, index.html,
# vite.config.ts) because it runs the vite dev server against the real
# frontend, unlike the server image which excludes it.
#
# Exclude host build outputs and native artifacts (they are platform-bound
# and regenerated inside the image) so the context stays small and a Windows
# checkout cannot leak Windows node_modules / target trees into the image.
.git/
src-tauri/
server-legacy/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
server/dist/
server/src/infra/prisma/generated/
e2e/support/virtual-printer/target/
test-results/
**/test-results/
playwright-report/
**/playwright-report/
coverage/
**/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.sample
